{
	$version: "0.1.71.1"
	name: "04: Economy"
	category: "00: Essentials"
	desc:
		'''
		The Kordel Denar is the primary currency used in the lands of Kordel.
		Most vendors will trade with this.
		'''
	
	order: 4
	size: [456, 0]
	layout: a
	flags: none
	
	title: "Economy"
	sprite_scale: 6
	sprite:
	{
		texture: ui_icons_widget
		size: [16, 16]
		frame: [3, 1]
	}
	entries:
	[
		{
			text: "While denar can be used for general trading with others, it is best used for official trade."
			color: "0xfffff0d8"
			flags: bullet
		}
		{
			text: "Markets are scattered across the region, their products are standardized and are always in stock. A nearby market is generally required for a successful base."
			color: "0xfffff0d8"
			flags: bullet
		}
		{
			text: "With a market, you can sell a variety of goods and resources to be compensated with money. Finding a good source of income is vital."
			color: "0xfffff0d8"
			flags: bullet
		}
		{
			text: "Skilled workers may require money as compensation when performing dangerous, laborious, complicated, or artistic crafts."
			color: "0xfffff0d8"
			flags: bullet
		}
	]
}